# Lycaeum Orientation Quest - Find 22 office signs
# Written by GutterRat

// Finds signs within an 18 tile radius (any floor)
// When in line of sight, notes the sign in notebook
// Note: When noting a sign, stand and wait for the system message that you have noted the sign.

// Script will still detect signs you've already found (but show **already found** when you are close), 
// so take some-what of a mental note of where youve been.

// If you get error: dclicktype - item or mobile type 61433 not found, use the >info command and get the ID from your notebook. 

while findtype 3017|2995|3082|3011|2966|3022|3007|3014|2989|3020|3010|2988|3019|3051|3013|3021|3015|3012|3018|3016 ground any any 18 as NoteSign

    overhead '**SIGN**' 53 NoteSign

    clearsysmsg

    while not targetexists
        dclicktype 61433 backpack
        waitfortarget 250
    endwhile

    waitfortarget 10000
    target NoteSign

    wait 500

    if insysmsg 'You take note of'
        overhead '**NEW SIGN**' 63 NoteSign

    elseif insysmsg 'already noted this sign'
        overhead '**ALREADY FOUND**' 53 NoteSign

    endif

    @ignore NoteSign

endwhile

wait 5000
@clearignore

loop